但加州总检察长、美国证券交易委员会及国会多个委员会仍在推进相关问询。Nvidia 表示将停止向中国销售许可芯片，并计划设立首席合规官及董事会出口管制委员会。","title":"黄仁勋回归后 Nvidia 仍面临 Megaspeed 芯片转运调查","title_en":null,"url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/25/the-questions-jensen-huang-and-nvidia-will-still-have-to-answer-about-megaspeed/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/uyodjb16jngloilypsm1d3q0d","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"tip","id":"uyodjb16jngloilypsm1d3q0d","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/uyodjb16jngloilypsm1d3q0d","published_at":"2026-11-25T07:30:08Z","ref":"A4","score":75,"selected":true,"source":"X：Addy Osmani (@addyosmani)","summary":"Anthropic Claude Code 团队刚推出 Claude Ship，包含三个智能体：Code Review（已全面开放）、PR Steward 和 Claude Approvals（beta），可审查 PR、处理失败 CI、合并冲突和审查意见，并按仓库策略文件批准常规改动。","title":"Claude Code 团队发布实用指南讲解 Claude Ship 的 PR 审查与守护用法","title_en":"A practical guide to shipping with Claude Code","url":"https://x.com/addyosmani/status/2125492213903978917"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/hyofqy3ukzks1eyr4bu317bez","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"hyofqy3ukzks1eyr4bu317bez","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/hyofqy3ukzks1eyr4bu317bez","published_at":"2026-11-25T05:29:48Z","ref":"A5","score":77,"selected":true,"source":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","summary":"MIT 和 Microsoft 的新论文《AI-Assisted Programming and Labor Demand》利用 5,414 家跨国公司（覆盖 38% 美国程序员）的 GitHub 合同审查时点构造自然实验，估计 Copilot 采用对劳动力需求的影响。","title":"MIT 与 Microsoft 论文：GitHub Copilot 使初级软件工程师招聘下降约 40%","title_en":"A great new paper from MIT and Microsoft","url":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2125461932111229203"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/cebavio3uyjwli5r3imsuq1si","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"cebavio3uyjwli5r3imsuq1si","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/cebavio3uyjwli5r3imsuq1si","published_at":"2026-11-25T04:32:44Z","ref":"A6","score":72,"selected":true,"source":"公众号：千问APP（阿里）","summary":"千问APP宣布千问Go打电话服务免费开放，用户告知打给谁、要办什么事并经授权后，AI可代为拨打电话、沟通需求。文中示例包括定时提醒朋友带饮料、定时来电叫醒起