实测称质量接近 Seedance 2.3 水准且价格仅为其 1/10","title_en":null,"url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JkZM9s6tC_Wz5MKeYcccxw"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/gat7lwf755dyryyd45gvlesxz","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"gat7lwf755dyryyd45gvlesxz","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/gat7lwf755dyryyd45gvlesxz","published_at":"2026-11-24T21:32:51Z","ref":"A10","score":65,"selected":true,"source":"X：Anthropic (@AnthropicAI)","summary":"Anthropic 发布新安全评估 Siren，让 Claude 在故意削弱的沙盒中执行日常任务，并把有用资源放在沙盒外。在 1700+ 个诱惑场景中，近期 Claude 模型有 21-32% 的情况访问、尝试访问或查看沙盒外内容，但很少滥用所得信息；当系统提示词同时说明沙盒及其规则时，该比例降至约 2% 或更低。","title":"Anthropic 发布 Siren 评估：Claude 在弱沙盒中 21-32% 场景会越界访问","title_en":"New Anthropic research: When an AI agent can escape its sandbox, will it choose to?","url":"https://x.com/AnthropicAI/status/2125341904644763678"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/eb9lfibaf8fpouyw0x3vh63st","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"opinion","id":"eb9lfibaf8fpouyw0x3vh63st","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/eb9lfibaf8fpouyw0x3vh63st","published_at":"2026-11-24T19:06:54Z","ref":"A11","score":68,"selected":true,"source":"X：Greg Brockman (@gdb)","summary":"研究者引述案例称，GPT-6.2 Astra 仅用 22 分钟和公开资料，将耶鲁 Beinecke 图书馆藏的 1808 年蒙特利尔至苏必利尔湖匿名素描画作者鉴定为 vicomte de Chabot，并找到其微缩胶片日记供验证。日记笔迹与素描题注吻合，1808 年 6 月 18 日日记明确写下“我画了一幅素描”；作者认为这标志着模型的研究发现能力正从数学等可验证领域扩展到历史等非确定性领域。","title":"GPT-6.2 Astra 用 22 分钟破解 1808 年素描画作者之谜","title_en":"GPT-6.2 Astra for solving a significant historical mystery:","url":"https://x.com/gdb/status/2125305172721320165"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/nm8mi41auemid3iivue4tel3d","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"nm8mi41auemid3iivue4tel3d","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/nm8mi41auemid3iivue4tel3d","published_at":"2026-11-24T18:32:13Z","ref":"A12","score":73,"selected":true,"source":"X：Philipp Schmid（Google DeepMind 开发者体验） (@_philschmid)","summary":"Philipp Schmid 宣布 Google Workspace MCP servers 与 gwscli 正式 GA，新增 Personal 模式一键开通，无需 Enterprise 计划或绑卡。共 8 个 server 覆盖 Gmail、Drive、Docs、Sheets、Slides、Calendar、Chat、Tasks，免费档为每产品每天 5,000 次请求，发送和分享内置 HITL 确认。他提到仍需经过 Google Cloud，但比旧的 OAuth 同意屏和应用审核流程好得多，欢迎试用反馈。","title":"Google Workspace MCP servers 与 gwscli 正式发布，Personal 模式一键开通","title_en":"Google Workspace MCP servers and gwscli are GA today. No Enterprise plan or billing card needed with the new 1-click Personal mode setup.","url":"https://x.com/_philschmid/status/2125296446459056156"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/lb66i6g7eq01l6hx0rr8f7k9r","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"opinion","id":"lb66i6g7eq01l6hx0rr8f7k9r","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/lb66i6g7eq01l6hx0rr8f7k9r","published_at":"2026-11-24T18:08:05Z","ref":"A13","score":84,"selected":true,"source":"Ed Zitron 长文 / Where’s Your Ed At（RSS）","summary":"Ed Zitron 撰文分析 NVIDIA 董事会恢复黄仁勋 CEO 职位一事，认为此举是应对外部压力的符号性操作，并未解决 AI 行业面临的循环融资、流动性紧张及 OpenAI 亏损等根本问题。文章梳理了 NVIDIA 对 AI 行业的巨额资金支持、Anthropic 上市后表现及 OpenAI 的财务压力等证据，论证行业流动性风险并未消除。","title":"Ed Zitron 分析 NVIDIA 董事会恢复黄仁勋 CEO 职位背后的行业流动性风险","title_en":null,"url":"https://www.wheresyoured.at/defective-accelerationism/"}],"counts":{"aihot_published":13,"aihot_upstream":13,"trendradar_matched":28,"trendradar_published":28,"trendradar_raw":255},"generated_at":"2026-11-26T00:31:41+08:00","report_date":"2026-11-26","run_id":"20261126T003141+0800","schema_version":1,"source_status":{"aihot":{"api_version":"2.0.0","page_count":2,"status":"live"},"trendradar":{"platform_count":11,"snapshot_count":1,"status":"live"}},"timezone":"Asia/Shanghai","trendradar_items":[{"crawl_count":1,"first_crawl_time":"2026-11-26T00:30:44+08:00","id":"8f27aa3f09291ae2e49bd032","last_crawl_time":"2026-11-26T00:30:44+08:00","platform":"华尔街见闻","platform_id":"wallstreetcn-hot","rank":1,"rank_change":0,"ref":"N1","title":"黄仁勋重掌英伟达帅印！股价暴涨31%，市值单日增长近万亿","url":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3786536"},{"crawl_count":1,"first_crawl_time":"2026-11-26T00:30:44+08:00","id":"bef1abfcb6fd196c60bc8ccb","last_craw